{"id":"cleroi","nameZh":"天赐","nameEn":"cleroi","star":"E","author":"UP","category":"机甲类-E","categoryLabel":"机甲（埃里克尔）","tier":2,"unitClass":"ErekirUnitType","isSubUnit":false,"packs":["UP的埃里克尔单位&建筑补丁整合包.hjson","UP的埃里克尔单位补丁包.hjson","UT和UP的S&E星单位补丁合集.hjson"],"description":"中型热射线机甲。T2级机甲类单位，拥有中型装甲，可以跨越大多数地形，攻击方式为从主炮发射双发炮弹，并搭载一门中央热熔射线枪，能持续灼烧地面敌人并产生火焰，对建筑伤害较低但对单位极为致命，天赐还加装了两台点防御炮塔，以增强自己的生存能力。\n天赐的设计在机甲线中独树一帜，它是少数同时拥有远程炮击和近程持续输出能力的单位，我们的工程师保留了其原先的双联主炮，专精于拆除敌方建筑；同时加装了一门橙黄色热熔射线枪，这道高亮光束会在地面扫过时留下火焰轨迹，被扫中的敌人将遭受持续灼烧。\n然而，热熔枪的冷却时间较长，每次照射后需要短暂休整，这让天赐的定位停留在了火力支援方面。","stats":{"health":1100.0,"armor":5.0,"speed":0.6,"hitSize":14.0,"range":190,"maxRange":190,"targetAir":true,"targetGround":true,"fogRadius":null,"payloadCapacity":null},"vanillaStats":{"health":1100.0,"armor":5.0,"speed":0.6,"hitSize":14.0,"range":null,"maxRange":null},"dps":{"direct":889.39,"splash":212.12,"total":1101.51,"air":659.39,"ground":889.39,"suicide":false,"targetAir":true,"targetGround":true},"vanillaDps":{"direct":307.88,"splash":78.18,"total":386.06,"air":307.88,"ground":307.88},"weapons":[{"name":"cleroi-weapon","weaponType":"Weapon","role":"damage","bulletType":"BasicBulletType","mode":"burst","reload":33.0,"reloadSec":0.55,"reloadExplicit":true,"shots":1,"shotDelay":0.0,"firstShotDelay":0.0,"damage":18.0,"splashDamage":25.0,"splashDamageRadius":20.0,"perShotDirect":18.0,"perShotSplash":25.0,"fragBullets":0,"fragDirect":0.0,"fragSplash":0.0,"dps":32.73,"perShot":18.0,"splashDps":45.45,"collidesAir":true,"collidesGround":true,"bulletRange":175.0,"continuous":false,"canHitAir":true,"canHitGround":true},{"name":"cleroi-point-defense","weaponType":"Weapon","role":"damage","bulletType":"BulletType","mode":"burst","reload":9.0,"reloadSec":0.15,"reloadExplicit":true,"shots":1,"shotDelay":0.0,"firstShotDelay":0.0,"damage":18.0,"splashDamage":25.0,"splashDamageRadius":20.0,"perShotDirect":18.0,"perShotSplash":25.0,"fragBullets":0,"fragDirect":0.0,"fragSplash":0.0,"dps":120.0,"perShot":18.0,"splashDps":166.67,"col